        "slc_8b6e6aeaf06e504be357c4de25779e23caa5ec69bb3e2efcb435dfde078451bb"
      ],
      "text": "An Automation Server can be paired with the Agent Server to run agents on a schedule or in response to events, dispatching conversations to the Agent Server/SDK."
    },
