        "slc_2de2a9883c03b85d131ea9ef71c0fab99fc0a736eabbbe68682b44c4d90b91e6"
      ],
      "text": "The project is split across repositories: this repo owns the frontend, backend selection, and local-stack orchestration, while the SDK owns the Agent Server API and the automation repo owns scheduling and dispatching."
    },
