        "slc_c71c929438fc5417283cd86ad281b231ec4ac650bc67e9b9ea53c7d972bb67fc"
      ],
      "text": "Running without a sandbox executes the agent-server directly on the host, where the agent has full filesystem access; the Docker option restricts agent access to projects under PROJECTS_PATH."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_117813620b870bc6441ccc1278877749b78300ab93e19feb74cb46c736d9a13f",
